  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger; cook, stirring occasionally, until the onion is lightly browned.",
    "Add beef; cook, browning on all sides.",
    "Add fish stock, bouillabaisse paste, liquid smoke, salt, and pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven.",
    "Braise for 2 1/2 hours, or until the beef is tender.",
    "Stir in diced tomatoes.",
    "Simmer over low heat for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro, if desired."
